    "title": "Westfield Police Department increases presence in neighborhoods through new model - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Todd Golden ,\n1 days ago The Westfield Police Department is increasing its presence in Westfield neighborhoods through a new district model that went into effect last month. WPD Chief Shawn Keen said officers will be encouraged to attend neighborhood gatherings and other community events to build trust in their districts, reflecting residents’ desire for an increased presence through a survey. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
